
==============================================================================================
 PART 1: ALL-n operator-symbol induction that Box_u^n gives the frame leg NO p_perp
==============================================================================================
   F2 backbone: each u.grad on the frame leg contributes (k0 + DELTA), DELTA=0 under F2.
   The graviton q enters via Gamma(h_TT) -> raises graviton-leg power (loop momentum q),
   NEVER converts to an explicit FRAME momentum p (p is external, set by the du_perp legs).
   n= 1: frame symbol = (k0)^2  -> has explicit p? False  | p^2 seed = 0
   [PASS] ALL-n symbol n=1: frame leg symbol is k0^2 (TIME only), NO explicit p^2 spatial seed
   n= 2: frame symbol = (k0)^4  -> has explicit p? False  | p^2 seed = 0
   [PASS] ALL-n symbol n=2: frame leg symbol is k0^4 (TIME only), NO explicit p^2 spatial seed
   n= 3: frame symbol = (k0)^6  -> has explicit p? False  | p^2 seed = 0
   [PASS] ALL-n symbol n=3: frame leg symbol is k0^6 (TIME only), NO explicit p^2 spatial seed
   n= 4: frame symbol = (k0)^8  -> has explicit p? False  | p^2 seed = 0
   [PASS] ALL-n symbol n=4: frame leg symbol is k0^8 (TIME only), NO explicit p^2 spatial seed
   n= 5: frame symbol = (k0)^10  -> has explicit p? False  | p^2 seed = 0
   [PASS] ALL-n symbol n=5: frame leg symbol is k0^10 (TIME only), NO explicit p^2 spatial seed
   n= 6: frame symbol = (k0)^12  -> has explicit p? False  | p^2 seed = 0
   [PASS] ALL-n symbol n=6: frame leg symbol is k0^12 (TIME only), NO explicit p^2 spatial seed
   n=10: frame symbol = (k0)^20  -> has explicit p? False  | p^2 seed = 0
   [PASS] ALL-n symbol n=10: frame leg symbol is k0^20 (TIME only), NO explicit p^2 spatial seed
   n=20: frame symbol = (k0)^40  -> has explicit p? False  | p^2 seed = 0
   [PASS] ALL-n symbol n=20: frame leg symbol is k0^40 (TIME only), NO explicit p^2 spatial seed

   INDUCTION (closed form): S_n(frame) = k0^{2n} for ALL n.  Base n=0: S_0=1 (identity).
   Step: S_{n+1} = (u.grad)^2 S_n; under F2 u.grad|_frame = i k0 (time only) => S_{n+1}=k0^2 S_n.
   => by induction S_n = k0^{2n} for every n>=0.  A p^2 SPATIAL factor requires a transverse
      derivative (DELTA!=0), which F2 forbids.  Hence the seagull frame KINETIC is p-FREE
      to ALL n.  (The graviton q lives in the loop factors, integrated -> a MASS/time
      coefficient on |du_perp|^2, never a p^2 cone.)
   [PASS] ALL-n CLOSED FORM: S_n = k0^{2n} has NO p-dependence for symbolic n (d/dp S_n = 0 identically)

